  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Consider a function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8469;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>, satisfying&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.&nbsp;Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2022</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2028</mn></mfenced></mstyle></mfrac></math> is equal to</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
