  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2022</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2028</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4044</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4056</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8100</mn></math></p>"
  }
